# Analytics / GA4

**Start every analytics, tracking or SEO-measurement task at [`docs/analytics/README.md`](../../docs/analytics/README.md)** (Matt 2026-10-14): the single source of truth and its Registry. Run `npm run analytics:audit` for the live state of GA4, Search Console and GTM through the service account; never a browser sign-in, never a new probe script. Extend a registered file; `ci:analytics-registry` fails an unregistered one.

Any script that opens our site (ryan-realty.com, localhost, 127.0.0.1, `*.vercel.app`) in a browser sets `rr_automation=1` and `rr_internal=1` before the first page load and never grants analytics consent; use `scripts/lib/marked-playwright.mjs`.
